<title>USA: Ortonville, Minn., won by FBS Investment.</title>
<headline>Ortonville, Minn., won by FBS Investment.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>FBS Investment said it won $2.020 million of Ortonville, Minn., general obligation loan anticipation bonds, Series 1997 A, with a net interest cost of 4.525 percent.</p>
</text>
